	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It starts with filing a copy for internal records. 
After filing a copy for internal records, creating a receiving report should be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, reporting errors to relevant team member needs to be done. 
When reporting errors to relevant team member is completed, you need to check dates to avoid penalty charges.
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the payment process and starts with filing a copy for internal records.
After completing a copy for internal records, the creating should be done of a receiving report.
Once a receipt report is created, it needs to be reported to the relevant team member.
When the reports to a relevant team member are completed, you must check dates to avoid penalties.
The process is completed now.
"
